  "change": "A fresh open retains original resolved and lexical route descriptors before full publication and retains the created segment through actual writer opening. It consumes that proof after final parent sync and pre/post route, access, segment and lock identity checks. Existing stores, standalone logs and public recovery retain full route publication.",
